OL,3,GNEWSAWomen steal from domestic violence
OL,4,Acharity shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity shop helping those
OL,7,Fexperiencing domestic violence said a
OL,8,Frecent instance of shoplifting was
OL,9,Fextremely disappointing.
OL,11,FLorraine Curston, who owns Dawn's New
OL,12,FHorizon in Sprowston, near Norwich,
OL,13,Fsaid two women had stolen two winter
OL,14,Fcoats from the shop's outdoor rail on
OL,15,FMonday by stuffing them inside a
OL,16,Fshopping trolley and running off.
OL,18,FShe said this was not the first time
OL,19,Fthe shop has been impacted by thieves
OL,20,Fand said it made staff feel vulnerable.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
