OL,3,GNEWSAWomen steal from domestic violence
OL,4,Acharity shop
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's heartbreaking. I can go in [the
OL,7,Fshop] and find tickets on the floor and
OL,8,FI have just cried. We are trying to
OL,9,Fraise money for a safe house... they
OL,10,Fare taking it away from the people who
OL,11,Fneed it," Curston added.
